config BR2_PACKAGE_TMD3725_USERSPACE_DRIVER
    bool "tmd3725-userspace-driver"
    help
      Userspace driver for the ams TMD3725 color sense(RGBC+IR), ambient light and proximity sensor.

      This implementation performs:
        - Ambient light sensing (ALS) with automatic ALS gain(AGAIN) control
        - Proximity detection with example thresholds
        - Lux (illuminance) calculation using open-air default coefficients
        - Correlated Color Temperature (CCT) estimation
        - Hue and Saturation color space conversion
        - CIE 1931 (x,y) chromaticity coordinates
        
      The driver communicates with the sensor via the I2C bus (/dev/i2c-x)
      Results are displayed on the console periodically.
